{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main0805_poke_01_01",
      "hash": "67195e63266b521b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "幽灵：……离开吧。"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main0805_poke_01_02",
      "hash": "67195f63266b53ce",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "从这里……离开吧……！"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main0805_rival_01",
      "hash": "1fb7dc95783b3aa0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]：哇！\\n又来了只更大的……！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main0805_rival_10",
      "hash": "1fb477957838592a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]，那个！\\n你快用刚才那个！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main0805_sys_01",
      "hash": "98a1dd67f92a9f67",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "原来幽灵的原形……\\c\\n是卡拉卡拉的母亲\\n四处徘徊的灵魂！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main0805_sys_02",
      "hash": "98a1de67f92aa11a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "四处徘徊的灵魂变回了\\n卡拉卡拉温柔的母亲……\\c\\n接着安详地升上天空……\\n就这样消失了……"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main0805_rival_02",
      "hash": "1fb7df95783b3fb9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]：……卡拉卡拉你\\n原来是因为思念妈妈，\\r\\n才到这里来的啊……"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main0805_poke_02_01",
      "hash": "123c266d35d38b24",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "卡拉卡拉：咔呜……"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main0805_rival_03",
      "hash": "1fb7de95783b3e06",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]：我居然那样\\n惧怕你的妈妈……真是对不起。"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main0805_rival_04",
      "hash": "1fb7e195783b431f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]，我……\\n我不想让卡拉卡拉觉得孤单，\\r\\n所以我要送它回家。\\c\\n对了！你如果在上面一层\\n遇到那个叫“富士”的人的话，\\r\\n可以帮忙把他带回家吗？"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_main0805_select_01",
      "hash": "db48292ea2290a98",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "你一个人回得去吗？"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_main0805_select_02",
      "hash": "db482c2ea2290fb1",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "就交给我吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_main0805_rival_05",
      "hash": "1fb7e095783b416c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]：没、没问题啦！\\n因为卡拉卡拉也在嘛。\\c\\n[VAR TRNAME(0000)]你真是\\n越来越靠得住了啊……"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_main0805_rival_06",
      "hash": "1fb7e395783b4685",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]：[VAR TRNAME(0000)]\\n一点都不害怕吗？\\c\\n你这充满自信的样子，\\n感觉可靠极了啊……"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_main0805_rival_07",
      "hash": "1fb7e295783b44d2",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "什么！？是你从火箭队那里\\n把卡拉卡拉救出来的！？"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "msg_main0805_rival_11",
      "hash": "1fb4789578385add",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "你是什么时候\\n变得这么厉害的啊……"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "id": "msg_main0805_rival_08",
      "hash": "1fb7e595783b49eb",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "既然如此……\\n就拜托[VAR TRNAME(0000)]了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "id": "msg_main0805_rival_09",
      "hash": "1fb7e495783b4838",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "好吧，我们走，卡拉卡拉！"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "id": "msg_main0805_poke_02_02",
      "hash": "123c296d35d3903d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "卡拉卡拉：咔唔！"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_main_event_0805_max",
      "hash": "29a8cb780fbc5a6c"
    }
  ]
}
